      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobaba, labazalwane, zwanini ukuziphendulela kwami engikwenza phambi kwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sebezwile ukuba ukhuluma labo ngolimi lwamaHeberu, bathula kakhulu, wasesithi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mina ngingumJuda owazalelwa eTarsusi elaseKilikhiya, kodwa ngakhulela kulumuzi, ngasenyaweni zikaGamaliyeli ngafundiswa ngokuqinileyo umlayo wabokhokho ngitshisekela uNkulunkulu njengani lonke lamhlanje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.34+ACT.5.35+ACT.5.36+ACT.5.37+ACT.5.38+ACT.5.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Seb 5:34–39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngazingela abantu baleyoNdlela kwaze kwaba sekufeni, ngibabopha, ngibanikela entolongweni abesilisa labesifazana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Seb 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:9–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "njengokuba umpristi omkhulu lomphakathi wonke wabadala ungangifakazela, ngazuza kubo incwadi eziya kubazalwane, ngaya eDamaseko ukuba lababekhona lapho ngibalethe eJerusalema bebotshiwe, ukuze batshaywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngisahamba sengisondela eDamaseko phakathi kwemini, kwahle kwangizingelezela ukukhanya okukhulu okuvela ezulwini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngawela phansi, ngezwa ilizwi lisithi kimi: Sawuli, Sawuli, ungizingelelani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaphendula ngathi: Ungubani, Nkosi, na? Wathi kimi: NginguJesu waseNazaretha omzingelayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo ababelami bakubona ukukhanya, kodwa kabalizwanga ilizwi lalowo owakhuluma lami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngathi: Ngenzeni, Nkosi, na? INkosi yathi kimi: Sukuma, uye eDamaseko, uzakutshelwa khona konke okumiselwe ukuba ukwenze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengokuba ngangingasaboni ngenxa yenkazimulo yalokhokukhanya, ngadonswa ngesandla yilabo ababelami, ngafika eDamaseko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAnaniya othile, indoda ekholwayo ngokomlayo, eyayinconywa yibo bonke abaJuda abahlala khona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weza kimi, wema phansi kwami, wathi kimi: Sawuli, mzalwane, buya ubone futhi. Mina ngasengibona ngalesosikhathi, ngamkhangela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: UNkulunkulu wabokhokho ukumisile ukuba uyazi intando yakhe, lokuba ubone oLungileyo, uzwe ilizwi eliphuma emlonyeni wakhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngoba uzakuba ngufakazi wakhe kubo bonke abantu walokho okubonileyo lokuzwileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pho, usalindeleni na? Sukuma, ubhaphathizwe, uhlanjululwe ezonweni zakho ngokukhuleka ebizweni lakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sengibuyele eJerusalema ngikhuleka ethempelini, ngafikelwa yisiyezi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngambona; wathi kimi: Phangisa uphume eJerusalema, ngoba kabazukubamukela ubufakazi bakho ngami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengisithi: Nkosi, bayazi bona ukuthi yimi engangibabopha ngibatshaya emasinagogeni wonke labo abakholwa kuwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lamuhla kuchithwa igazi likaStefane ufakazi wakho, ngangimi khona mina, ngivuma, ngilondoloze ingubo zalabo abambulalayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.58"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Seb 7:58",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Hamba, ngoba ngizakukuthumela khatshana kwabezizwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamlalela kwaze kwafika kulelolizwi; basebephakamisa ilizwi labo, bathi: Msuseni umuntu onje emhlabeni! Ngoba kakufanele ukuba asile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi besamemeza, bezunguza ingubo zabo, bephosa uthuli emoyeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "induna enkulu yalaya ukuba angeniswe endlini yamabutho, yathi kahlolwe ngokutshaywa, ukuze ibone ukuthi kungani bememeza kangaka ngaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sebembophile ngemichilo, uPawuli wathi enduneni yekhulu eyayimi khona: Kuvunyelwe yini ukutshaya umuntu ongumRoma engalahlwanga licala na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Induna yekhulu isikuzwile lokhu yaya enduneni enkulu, yathi kuyo: Uzakwenza njani na? Ngoba lumuntu ungumRoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho induna enkulu yafika, yathi kuye: Ngitshele, wena ungumRoma na? Yena wathi: Yebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Induna enkulu yaphendula yathi: Mina ngalithenga lelolungelo ngemali enkulu. UPawuli wathi: Kodwa mina ngazalwa lalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
