              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho labo ababezakumhlola basuka kuye masinyane; lenduna enkulu layo yesaba isisazi ukuthi uPawuli ungumRoma lokuthi ibimbophile. ",
          "type": "text",
