        {
          "text": "Kwathi kusasa ifuna ukwazi iqiniso lalokhu abaJuda abammangalela ngakho, yamkhulula, yalaya ukuba abapristi abakhulu lomphakathi wonke ubuthane, yamletha uPawuli yammisa phambi kwabo.",
